'''Yoda's quarters''',<ref name="Dark Disciple">''[[Dark Disciple]]''</ref> also known as '''Yoda's living space''',<ref name="The Glass Abyss">''[[Mace Windu: The Glass Abyss]]''</ref> were the private living quarters that [[Yoda]], the last [[Grand Master]] of the [[Jedi Order]], maintained at the main [[Imperial Palace|Jedi Temple]] on [[Coruscant]].<ref name="Dark Disciple" /> The Grand Master would retreat there to rest and [[Meditation|meditate]] on the will of [[the Force]]. As was typical of [[Jedi]] quarters, it was simple and sparsely furnished,<ref name="Temple Gallery">{{Databank|url=jedi-temple-location-gallery|title=Jedi Temple Location Gallery}}; image #15 {{C|of 22}}</ref> although it did contain a soothing fountain made of [[singing stone]]s.<ref name="Dark Disciple" />

